<item>
<title>Russia's war in Ukraine: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ukraine/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ukraine-2026-11-09T17:42:57.418Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 17:42:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ukraine and Russia are exchanging intensified strikes as Ukraine hits a St Petersburg plant that produces missile fuel and a Russian refinery in Saratov, while Russia conducts missile and drone attacks on Ukrainian power facilities and the Northern Bridge. Both sides have also targeted energy infrastructure in other regions, with Russian strikes damaging the Ukrainian power grid and Ukrainian attacks damaging Russia’s second-largest refinery, prompting Rosneft to cap sales. Russia has begun rationing petrol after the Ukrainian refinery attacks, and a Russian FPV drone wounded three energy workers in Sumy Oblast amid widespread outages. The United Nations Security Council is monitoring the situation as peace talks are set to begin in Abu Dhabi, and the UCDP recorded 75,767 battle-related deaths in 2024.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/09/world/europe/ukraine-russia-peace-talks.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168761&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/06/world/asia/china-trump-putin-xi-summit.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOeVd1TTl3TGdIcE1yeWtZVUJ0UFhsUVZBWVZYaHczRWFWa1lqZndtd1loTS1NcVMxWmNGOGM0bVdDbERZcTRWSGtjSVdFb003NFN2SDhKRWlYTW9iRkVTSXRMeDczaENXclBRVWp5eW1CYkYydFQzWjYyaVJ6WklTYXpiVG8?oc=5&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPWWtZT193eDlnanMxSDhzN0V1VVZHbHpCQzdMRHJXeGtIVXA1R0hXVHItLXpkZ1pueDN1WnVTWnhiczRyT0JvckpUTGFoWm5KdEthbHJ3Q19uVlNMNnZZUnhOMTdvU0JmTHFpdzZtakVITXFBYjAza1Yyd1R4eDVmTXA0Uk5FWUJMVXFEcUZvekpWS3NpblZiUlFwRGVZWENzMWxWY01WRk9SQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/a